# sdist content control (§8 packaging promise, §10 K-1):
# the wheel already ships exactly the package modules plus ssoptim/characters/*.yml
# (include-package-data = false + explicit [tool.setuptools.package-data]), but the
# sdist manifest follows the VCS-tracked file list, so the repo-only dirs are pruned
# here to keep both halves of the promise. The repo-root characters/ and plugins/ are
# the user's own copies; wiki_data/ is git-ignored reference material (R-44) anyway.
# The patterns are root-level names, so ssoptim/characters/ (the bundled set) stays in.
skip tests
prune tests
skip characters
prune characters
skip plugins
prune plugins
skip wiki_data
prune wiki_data
